{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30192","headline":"除浙东留题桂郡林亭 · 元晦","name":"除浙东留题桂郡林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫泥远自金銮降，朱斾翻驰镜水头。\n陶令风光偏畏夜，子牟衰鬓暗惊秋。\n西隣月色何时见，南国春光岂再游。\n莫遣艳歌催客醉，不堪回首翠蛾愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元晦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}